  npcName: Marskin
  npcPotrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3606a2f45cdd944cb1f0fc0473eaafe, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - You walk heavy for a land this quiet.
  - "Name\u2019s Marskin. I\u2019m not lost\u2026 just waiting."
  - "Out there beneath the ice lives a small octopus. Nothing legendary \u2014 just
    quick, smart, and stubborn."
  - Clever thing. It learns the shape of your shadow before it shows its own.
  - "I\u2019ve watched this hole for three days."
  - "The sea will blink soon\u2026 and when it does, I\u2019ll be ready."
